badges; Gyro Ball, Thunderbolt, Flamethrower and Ice Beam from six; Giga Impact
from eight. Goldenrod 4F sells the Silk Scarf, Wide Lens, Zoom Lens and
Metronome from four. The Game Corners' prize Pokemon are all wild or given
elsewhere. Made by tools/hack/corner_items.py.

